                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 720,
                  "content": "The Pacific Crest Trail stretches from the Mexican border at Campo, California to Manning Park at the Canadian border in Washington. Paul will traverse deserts, mountain passes, and ancient forests — documenting every step of his journey.",
