                  "name": "causeQuote",
                  "fill": "#FFFFFFAA",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "&quot;In the last few years, I lost both of my parents to cancer. This trail isn’t just a walk — it’s a promise. A promise that their struggle wasn’t in vain, and that we can do more to prevent others from going through the same pain.&quot;",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
