                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "This website documents Paul Barry's Pacific Crest Trail thru-hike in 2026 and serves as a platform to raise awareness and funds for cancer research, patient support, and prevention education. The site is operated on a non-commercial, charitable basis.",
