                      "name": "a2desc",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The physical and mental demands of thru-hiking the PCT — training, nutrition, gear, and the psychological challenge of walking every single day for six months through some of America's most extreme landscapes.",
