                      "name": "a3desc",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "With 1 in 3 people receiving a cancer diagnosis in their lifetime, community-funded awareness campaigns play a critical role. This angle explores how individual acts of endurance translate into real research funding.",
