          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "31szo",
              "name": "fpSec1",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "pioAN",
                  "name": "sec1t",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "content": "1. Our Commitment to Transparency",
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "AQfY7",
                  "name": "sec1p1",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "YesChapter is Paul Barry's personal fundraising campaign for his 2026 Pacific Crest Trail thru-hike. Every dollar donated goes directly to cancer research, patient support, and prevention through our partner foundations. Paul does not receive any compensation, salary, or personal benefit from donations made through this website.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ixNdv",
                  "name": "sec1p2",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "This page exists to provide full transparency about how your donations are handled, which organizations receive funds, and how money is distributed.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "z9YaY",
              "name": "fpSec2",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "x40Bd",
                  "name": "sec2t",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "content": "2. Paul Takes Nothing",
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "p443e",
                  "name": "sec2p1",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Paul Barry personally funds his own hike — including gear, food, permits, travel, and all expenses. Zero percent of your donation goes toward Paul's hiking costs or personal expenses. This is a personal commitment, and Paul covers 100% of his own way.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "gXUFM",
                  "name": "sec2p2",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Your donation is passed through in full to our partner cancer foundations, minus only standard payment processing fees charged by Stripe (approximately 2.9% + $0.30 per transaction). YesChapter does not add any additional fees or administrative charges.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "zhUvp",
              "name": "fpSec3",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "KgDUd",
                  "name": "sec3t",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "content": "3. Partner Foundations",
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "vR2JR",
                  "name": "sec3p1",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "YesChapter partners with established, registered cancer foundations to ensure your donations have maximum impact. Our partner foundations are selected based on their track record, transparency, and alignment with our mission of funding cancer research, patient support, and prevention programs.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Lawsr",
                  "name": "sec3p2",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Partner foundations will be announced prior to the hike start date. Each partner undergoes due diligence to confirm their charitable registration status, financial transparency, and program effectiveness. Details about each partner — including their mission, programs, and registration numbers — will be published on this page.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "FqMbX",
              "name": "fpSec4",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "gpNRl",
                  "name": "sec4t",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "content": "4. Fund Distribution",
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ypSX1",
                  "name": "sec4p1",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Donations are split equally (50/50) between two geographic regions to honor both of Paul's parents — his father in California and his mother in Sydney, Australia. This means:",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "fBHYl",
                  "name": "sec4p2",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "• 50% goes to a US-based cancer foundation (California focus)\n• 50% goes to an Australian cancer foundation (Sydney focus)\n\nThis split reflects Paul's personal connection to both regions and ensures funds support cancer patients and research in the communities closest to his family's story.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "FUXgU",
              "name": "fpSec5",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "cJjiV",
                  "name": "sec5t",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "content": "5. Legal Relationship",
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "7yZ4R",
                  "name": "sec5p1",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "YesChapter is a personal fundraising initiative operated by Paul Barry. It is not a registered charity, nonprofit organization, or 501(c)(3) entity. Donations made through YesChapter are directed to our partner foundations, which are independently registered charitable organizations in their respective jurisdictions.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ALFXO",
                  "name": "sec5p2",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Tax deductibility of your donation depends on the partner foundation receiving the funds and your local tax laws. We recommend consulting a tax professional for guidance specific to your situation. Partner foundation registration details and tax-exempt status information will be listed in their respective profiles above.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "9WoLK",
              "name": "fpSec6",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "fREXI",
                  "name": "sec6t",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "content": "6. Partnership Agreements",
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "hW6RG",
                  "name": "sec6p1",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Formal partnership agreements are established between Paul Barry (operating as YesChapter) and each partner foundation. These agreements outline:",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "pnIx6",
                  "name": "sec6p2",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "• The scope of the fundraising relationship\n• Fund transfer schedules and methods\n• Reporting obligations (how foundations report fund usage back to donors)\n• Use-of-name and branding permissions\n• Duration of the partnership\n• Termination conditions and procedures\n\nCopies of partnership agreements (or summaries) may be made available upon request by emailing paul@yeschapter.com.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "rkA6y",
              "name": "fpSec7",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nVTul",
                  "name": "sec7t",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "content": "7. How Funds Are Transferred",
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "p6Nmc",
                  "name": "sec7p1",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Donations collected through Stripe are held in YesChapter's Stripe account and transferred to partner foundations on a regular schedule (monthly or at agreed milestones). Transfers are made via bank transfer or check directly to the foundation's verified accounts.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "8vMN0",
                  "name": "sec7p2",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A running total of funds raised and distributed will be published on this page. We aim to transfer funds within 30 days of collection, though timing may vary based on partnership agreement terms.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "ZUKX7",
              "name": "fpSec8",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "EwdSO",
                  "name": "sec8t",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "content": "8. Accountability & Reporting",
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "erqwA",
                  "name": "sec8p1",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "We believe donors deserve to know exactly where their money goes. To that end, we commit to:",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "EJZtg",
                  "name": "sec8p2",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "• Publishing the total amount raised and distributed on this page\n• Sharing confirmation receipts from partner foundations when funds are transferred\n• Providing periodic updates through the Journal about the impact of donations\n• Making ourselves available to answer donor questions via paul@yeschapter.com\n\nIf a partnership with a foundation ends or changes, donors will be notified through the website and any undistributed funds will be redirected to an alternative qualified cancer foundation.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "pwXxs",
              "name": "fpSec9",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "eR6YU",
                  "name": "sec9t",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "content": "9. Questions & Contact",
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "3brBl",
                  "name": "sec9p1",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "If you have questions about our foundation partnerships, how funds are distributed, or anything related to the transparency of this campaign, please reach out:\n\nEmail: paul@yeschapter.com\nWebsite: yeschapter.com\n\nWe welcome questions and believe transparency builds trust. Paul is personally committed to answering every donor inquiry.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
