                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Cancer Council NSW is one of Australia's leading cancer charities, headquartered in Sydney. They fund more than $45 million annually in cancer research, alongside education, prevention programs, and direct support services assisting thousands of patients and families across New South Wales.",
