              "name": "sec1desc",
              "fill": "#FFFFFFAA",
              "content": "COMPLETED:\n\n• PUT /api/pledges now supports manual increases (addAmount without challengeId)\n• Records all increases in boosts[] array with challengeId: \"manual\"\n• Inline \"Increase Pledge\" form on /my-pledge — preset buttons ($0.01, $0.02, $0.05, $0.10) + custom stepper\n• Live impact preview: shows current rate → new rate → added total for cancer research\n• Sends confirmation email (sendPledgeIncreased) with old vs new rate comparison\n• Email includes share CTA to recruit new pledgers",
