              "name": "sec2desc",
              "fill": "#FFFFFFAA",
              "content": "COMPLETED:\n\n• Nudge emails sent when Paul is within 50mi of milestones (500, 1000, 1325, 2000, 2650)\n• Triggered by existing 6hr milestone cron — no new cron needed\n• Each nudge sent only once (Redis set: emails:nudges:sent)\n• Shows: current running total, projected total at milestone, \"INCREASE MY PLEDGE\" CTA\n• Includes \"Share with a friend\" link\n• New email template: sendPreMilestoneNudge() in src/lib/email.ts",
