              "name": "sec3desc",
              "fill": "#FFFFFFAA",
              "content": "COMPLETED:\n\n• Weekly update email: added \"INCREASE MY PLEDGE\" green button below trail map CTA + \"Share with a friend\" link\n• Milestone email: added \"Double down on this milestone?\" section with increase button + share link\n• Pledge confirmation email: added \"SHARE WITH A FRIEND\" orange button after registration\n• New email template: sendPledgeIncreased() — shows old→new rate comparison, added total, share CTA\n• All emails now link to /my-pledge for inline increase (not /pledge)",
