            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "l8Xwx",
              "name": "sec5desc",
              "fill": "#FFFFFFAA",
              "content": "COMPLETED:\n\n• New page: /honor — personalized pledge summary with direct foundation donation links\n  - Email lookup → final pledge total with 50/50 split\n  - Direct \"DONATE\" buttons linking to Tower Cancer Research + Cancer Council NSW\n  - \"I've honored my pledge\" confirmation button (updates Redis)\n  - Running counter: X of Y pledgers have honored (Z%)\n  - How it works explainer (3 steps)\n\n• New API: /api/honor — GET (pledge + community stats), POST (mark as honored)\n• New API: /api/honor/stats — Admin endpoint for honor rate tracking\n• Redis keys: pledger:{hash}.honored, pledger:{hash}.honoredAt, pledgers:honored_count\n\n• Post-finish email drip (2 reminders):\n  - Day 5: Gentle reminder with pledge total + honor rate + CTA\n  - Day 14: Final nudge with urgency framing + honor rate\n  - Only sent to pledgers who haven't honored yet (skips honored ones)\n  - New cron: /api/emails/honor runs daily at noon UTC\n  - Deduplicated via Redis set: emails:honor:sent\n\n• Admin honor tracking tab:\n  - Honor rate %, honored count, not-yet-honored count, total pledged\n  - Visual progress bar\n  - Added to all 3 admin view tabs (journal, challenges, honor)\n\n• PledgeRecord type updated with honored?: boolean and honoredAt?: number",
              "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
