                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Qa3zP",
          "name": "divAudit",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": 1,
          "fill": "#FFFFFF15"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "5uG7r",
          "name": "Gap 6 — Email Preferences",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "RCp3H",
              "name": "g6badge",
              "fill": "#FF4444",
              "content": "GAP 6 — CRITICAL",
              "fontFamily": "Barlow Semi Condensed",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "aTwdG",
              "name": "g6title",
              "fill": "#FFFFFF",
              "content": "Unsubscribe & Email Frequency Preferences",
              "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
              "fontSize": 24,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "l2ecq",
              "name": "g6desc",
              "fill": "#FFFFFFAA",
              "content": "Problem: Pledgers receive 76–92 emails over the hike with NO way to opt out or reduce frequency. This violates CAN-SPAM best practices and risks Resend deliverability issues (spam complaints, bounces).\n\nPlan:\n• Add unsubscribe token to PledgeRecord (unique per pledger, stored in Redis)\n• Add unsubscribe link to EVERY email footer: \"Manage preferences | Unsubscribe\"\n• Create /unsubscribe?token=xxx page with 3 frequency tiers:\n  1. ALL UPDATES — weekly + milestones + nudges + challenges (default)\n  2. MILESTONES ONLY — milestone reached + near-finish + honor reminders\n  3. FINISH ONLY — only the \"Paul made it\" email + honor reminders\n• Add emailPreference field to PledgeRecord: \"all\" | \"milestones\" | \"finish\"\n• Update ALL cron routes to check preference before sending\n• Honor reminders (day 5, day 14) always sent regardless of preference — these are transactional\n\nFiles to modify:\n• src/lib/types.ts — add unsubscribeToken + emailPreference to PledgeRecord\n• src/lib/email.ts — add unsubscribe footer to ALL 9 email templates\n• src/app/api/pledges/route.ts — generate unsubscribeToken on pledge creation\n• src/app/api/emails/weekly/route.ts — filter by preference\n• src/app/api/emails/milestone/route.ts — filter by preference\n• NEW: src/app/unsubscribe/page.tsx — preference management page\n• NEW: src/app/api/unsubscribe/route.ts — GET (fetch prefs) + PUT (update prefs)",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "CxQvh",
          "name": "div6",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": 1,
          "fill": "#FFFFFF15"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "oWN7Y",
          "name": "Gap 7 — Welcome Drip",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "aGf3u",
              "name": "g7badge",
              "fill": "#C45C26",
              "content": "GAP 7 — HIGH PRIORITY",
              "fontFamily": "Barlow Semi Condensed",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Ruw8c",
              "name": "g7title",
              "fill": "#FFFFFF",
              "content": "Welcome Drip Sequence (Post-Pledge Onboarding)",
              "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
              "fontSize": 24,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "VlSIr",
              "name": "g7desc",
              "fill": "#FFFFFFAA",
              "content": "Problem: After pledging, the pledger gets ONE confirmation email then silence until the next Monday (up to 6 days). This is a critical window to build the habit of checking in and sharing.\n\nPlan — 2-email welcome sequence:\n• Email 1 (Day 1, ~24hrs after pledge): \"How to Track Paul's Progress\"\n  - Links to /my-pledge (\"Bookmark this — your live dashboard\")\n  - Links to /trail-map (\"Watch Paul move in real time\")\n  - Shows their pledge math: $X/mile × 2,650 miles = $Y total\n  - Warm tone: \"You're now one of [count] people walking with Paul\"\n\n• Email 2 (Day 3, ~72hrs after pledge): \"Bring a Friend Along\"\n  - Social sharing CTA: \"Know someone who'd care about this?\"\n  - Link to referral page (/join?ref=xxx — see Gap 10)\n  - Show community growth: \"[count] pledgers and counting\"\n  - Light nudge: \"Already want to increase? Visit /my-pledge\"\n\nImplementation:\n• Store pledgeTimestamp in PledgeRecord (already have createdAt)\n• New cron: /api/emails/welcome — runs every 6 hours\n• Checks all pledgers where createdAt is 20–28hrs ago (email 1) or 68–76hrs ago (email 2)\n• Deduplication via Redis set: emails:welcome:sent:{emailHash}\n• New email templates: sendWelcomeDay1() + sendWelcomeDay3()\n• Add to vercel.json crons\n\nFiles:\n• src/lib/email.ts — add 2 new templates\n• NEW: src/app/api/emails/welcome/route.ts — welcome drip cron\n• vercel.json — add welcome cron schedule",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "D2Bco",
          "name": "div7",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": 1,
          "fill": "#FFFFFF15"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "ErZzB",
          "name": "Gap 8 — Community Milestones",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "f5f1z",
              "name": "g8badge",
              "fill": "#C45C26",
              "content": "GAP 8 — MEDIUM PRIORITY",
              "fontFamily": "Barlow Semi Condensed",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "p0X9q",
              "name": "g8title",
              "fill": "#FFFFFF",
              "content": "Community Milestone Notifications",
              "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
              "fontSize": 24,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "KkbqZ",
              "name": "g8desc",
              "fill": "#FFFFFFAA",
              "content": "Problem: Currently ALL milestone emails are about Paul's trail progress. There are no notifications for community achievements — moments that create social proof and FOMO.\n\nPlan — 4 community milestone triggers:\n• \"We hit [N] pledgers!\" — at 25, 50, 100, 200, 500 pledgers\n• \"$[X] total pledged!\" — at $5K, $10K, $25K, $50K thresholds\n• \"Pledgers from [N] countries!\" — at 5, 10, 25 countries (uses geo data from pledge form)\n• \"[Name] just became our biggest pledger!\" — when someone takes #1 on leaderboard\n\nEmail content:\n• Celebration tone: \"The community just hit a milestone!\"\n• Show the stat prominently (big number)\n• Social proof: \"You're one of [count] people walking with Paul\"\n• CTA: \"INCREASE MY PLEDGE\" + \"SHARE WITH A FRIEND\"\n• Leaderboard teaser: \"See where you rank →\"\n\nImplementation:\n• New email template: sendCommunityMilestone(variant, stats)\n• Trigger on pledge creation (POST /api/pledges) — check thresholds after incrementing count\n• Deduplication via Redis set: emails:community:sent (e.g., \"pledgers:50\", \"total:10000\")\n• No new cron needed — fires synchronously when threshold crossed during pledge creation\n\nFiles:\n• src/lib/email.ts — add sendCommunityMilestone()\n• src/app/api/pledges/route.ts — add threshold checks after pledge creation\n• src/lib/types.ts — no changes needed",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Yg1GV",
          "name": "div8",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": 1,
          "fill": "#FFFFFF15"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "9v5lr",
          "name": "Gap 9 — Honor Confirmation Email",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "2UHW9",
              "name": "g9badge",
              "fill": "#C45C26",
              "content": "GAP 9 — MEDIUM PRIORITY",
              "fontFamily": "Barlow Semi Condensed",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "DWYp9",
              "name": "g9title",
              "fill": "#FFFFFF",
              "content": "Honor Confirmation & Thank-You Email",
              "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
              "fontSize": 24,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "eO0kT",
              "name": "g9desc",
              "fill": "#FFFFFFAA",
              "content": "Problem: When a pledger visits /honor and clicks \"I've honored my pledge\", they see a green checkmark on the page — but receive NO email confirmation. This is a missed moment of gratitude and sharing.\n\nPlan:\n• Send a thank-you email immediately when POST /api/honor succeeds\n• Content:\n  - \"Thank you, [Name]. You honored your pledge.\"\n  - Summary: $X total pledged, split 50/50 between Tower Cancer Research + Cancer Council NSW\n  - Community stat: \"You're one of [honored] pledgers who've honored so far ([rate]%)\"\n  - Emotional close: \"Paul never touches a cent. Every dollar goes directly to the foundations.\"\n  - Share CTA: \"Tell someone what you did\" — shareable link/badge\n  - Optional: downloadable \"I honored my pledge\" badge image for social media\n\nImplementation:\n• New email template: sendHonorConfirmation(email, name, totalPledge, honoredCount, pledgerCount, honorRate)\n• Called from POST /api/honor after marking pledge as honored\n• Fire-and-forget (no retry needed — page already shows success)\n\nFiles:\n• src/lib/email.ts — add sendHonorConfirmation()\n• src/app/api/honor/route.ts — call sendHonorConfirmation after successful honor",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "8XNY3",
          "name": "div9",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": 1,
          "fill": "#FFFFFF15"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "SkrZw",
          "name": "Gap 10 — Referral Landing Page",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "7vuPs",
              "name": "g10badge",
              "fill": "#8C8A87",
              "content": "GAP 10 — NICE TO HAVE",
              "fontFamily": "Barlow Semi Condensed",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ac5aC",
              "name": "g10title",
              "fill": "#FFFFFF",
              "content": "Referral Landing Page & Share Tracking",
              "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
              "fontSize": 24,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "D7xF2",
              "name": "g10desc",
              "fill": "#FFFFFFAA",
              "content": "Problem: Every email has a \"SHARE WITH A FRIEND\" button, but the link goes to the homepage. When a friend clicks, they see a generic landing page with no context about who referred them or why.\n\nPlan:\n• Create /join?ref=[name] referral landing page\n• Content:\n  - \"[Name] is walking with Paul. Join them.\"\n  - Brief explainer of the pledge model\n  - Prominent pledge CTA\n  - Show community stats: pledger count, total pledged\n  - Personal touch: \"[Name] pledged $X per mile\"\n\n• Share links in emails point to /join?ref=[encodedName] instead of homepage\n• Track referral source: add referredBy field to PledgeRecord\n• Optional: show \"You brought [N] friends\" on /my-pledge dashboard\n\nImplementation:\n• NEW: src/app/join/page.tsx — referral landing page (reads ?ref= param)\n• src/lib/email.ts — update share URLs in all templates to use /join?ref=\n• src/app/api/pledges/route.ts — accept optional referredBy field\n• src/lib/types.ts — add referredBy?: string to PledgeRecord\n• src/app/my-pledge/page.tsx — optional: show referral count",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "Source Serif 4",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
